{"id":"difi_cil","lemma":"difícil","pos":"adj","rank":294,"glosses":["difficult, hard, tough, challenging, rough, tricky, trying, arduous, testing","unlikely (i.e. improbable)","awkward (e.g. situation or position)"],"ipa":"/diˈfiθil/","forms":{"femininePlural":"difíciles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-dif%C3%ADcil.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es difícil de decir.","en":"That's hard to say.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/550033"},{"text":"Las matemáticas son realmente difíciles.","en":"Math is really hard.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/871945"},{"text":"El francés es difícil.","en":"French is difficult.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302474"},{"text":"No hagas preguntas tan difíciles.","en":"Don't ask such hard questions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38411"},{"text":"¿Es difícil el francés?","en":"Is French difficult?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302478"}]}